+# CI triage: build #1203
+
+The 502 test returns an HTML page, and response.json() throws a SyntaxError on it.
+That error was not caught in request(), so it escaped as an unhandled rejection and vitest exited 1.
+The log names a different test because the error surfaces asynchronously.
+Fix: wrap the body parse in try/catch and fall back to no payload.
